    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab743fb1f163747a977000fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神强忍已久的泪水\n终于从眼眶中滑落。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd1d45dd00f1517a214d52128e0d2304d3a5aca1d52819ab4a19e872e377cf7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19a64a4725e7ef42a9d6b48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她激动地放声大哭，\n我为了不让她更难过，\n一直静静地在一旁陪着她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8852ad8bee97ef01b6959c7e13c4abbf4adfe5ca0aaee78c9c3cc20e1635f2d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e86f4a1d63321536c5afbde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "等到她哭完，稍微冷静之后，\n我们再一起思考接下来该怎么做。",
