    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a736e59976f213663d1d5f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把艾尼斯风神抬到休息室。\n经过一些简易的检查，\n确认她身体没有大碍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3defa4906567fc968afc71b397c373bbff930561139728de813018f4b1adc1c",
