      "uid": "zhcn:e26c2bfde8da60a823166718",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“大阪杯”是春季的GⅠ竞赛。\n草地2000米的距离对她来说没有问题，\n和朝日杯FS一样办在阪神赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de7d63c61f2dbff0211a35d8198afed3b059e3888d3e2de41449e6ccb31eb5b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
